cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this workflow, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "genotyping: an Axiom SNP microarray CEL-to-VCF Snakemake workflow"
abstract: >-
  A Snakemake workflow that converts Applied Biosystems / Thermo Fisher Axiom
  SNP microarray .CEL files into annotated VCF files (hg19 and lifted over to
  hg38), by driving Analysis Power Tools (APT) and SNPolisher through the Axiom
  Best Practices workflow. Intended for genotyping donors so that pooled
  single-cell RNA-seq data can be demultiplexed.
